  m_text: "<size=150%>Controls</size>\n\n\t        /    to move\n         /    /    
    to interact\n     /    /                  /    /          in Minigames\n\n<size=80%>Grab
    seeds out of the seed boxes.\nPlant them, and fulfill their needs, with the watering
    can, the banjo and the fly swatter.\nWhen fully grown, transport the vegtables
    into the sell box.\nFullfil the daily demands to progress.\n</size>"
